  "reference_recipe": {
    "full": "SavedF1.reference_case(reference_kind=motif,digits=90/128,paired_reference at 128). Reuse original CAR/exterior reference and independent law. Initialize SavedF1 from seven verified input bytes and fixture_bundle_path=handoff/f1_bundle.json. resolve_case only after approval.",
    "local": "For each typed region at 90/128 digits use matching arm independent_law tau. alpha=coefficient_sign*ctx.atan(tau/(event.taylor_order+1)); central P=Z on original support. Multiply cos(alpha)I-i sin(alpha)P on the LEFT in original occurrence order. Use reference.controlled_operator. Candidate operator is never a reference input.",
    "adjoint": "circuits.actual_adjoint(result) versus reference.controlled_operator(ctx,U).H",
    "wrapper": "circuits.hadamard_wrapper(result,spec,axis,measure=True); occupied (0,1), sole terminal ancilla measure. Compiled operator removes only that measure retaining prep/readout and phase.",
    "gates": "gates.controlled_gate for local/full; matrix_gate for adjoint/compiled; wrapper_signal and signal_gate for X/Y. high_precision_agreement at 1e-60. Each controlled_gate invokes Operator once and also checks unitarity. SavedF1 paired full references also compare H,D,R: 24 full matrix comparisons plus 10 local =34; four independent complex-signal comparisons."
  },
